# Everything in this folder either is, or describes, real Altura and Steva records:
# live bank account numbers, tax identification numbers, registry identifiers and
# the names of real people. None of it is tracked.
#
# The one exception is fixtures.json, the masked demo seed. That is safe to commit,
# safe to publish and safe to put in a screenshot. Use it for anything anyone other
# than the owner will see.
#
# Locally this folder also holds README.md (the index and entity facts),
# bml-csv-import.md, extraction-cases.md, mira-revenue-types.md and source/.
# Read those on the owner's machine.

*
!.gitignore
!fixtures.json
